OL,3,GNEWSABurnham does not view Wales as an 
OL,4,Aequal nation, claims first minister    
OL,6,FThe first minister says he wants an    
OL,7,Furgent meeting with the prime minister 
OL,8,Fafter Andy Burnham rejected calls to   
OL,9,Fgive more powers to the Welsh          
OL,10,Fgovernment.                            
OL,12,FRhun ap Iorwerth said he was "deeply   
OL,13,Fdisappointed" and that the PM "does not
OL,14,Fview Wales as an equal nation".        
OL,16,FIn a letter to ap Iorwerth last week,  
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said he was
OL,18,F"not persuaded" by the case to devolve 
OL,19,Fresponsibilities over policing and     
OL,20,Fjustice, the Crown Estate and rail     
OL,21,Finfrastructure to Wales.               
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
